## Application Testing Results

I tested the application using a reusable water bottle with the features reusable, stainless steel, 750 mL, and leakproof lid. Each writing tone generated a different product description, demonstrating how the language model can adjust its writing style for different audiences. All four descriptions passed the application's basic automated screening. However, some results still included unsupported product claims, showing that the screening system has limitations and that human review remains important.
